/** Merges a game type's own base properties with the active game mode's
 *  overlay — mode wins on the 3 keys it controls (gamemode/hardcore/
 *  difficulty); everything else the type declares (pvp, spawn-protection,
 *  view-distance, ...) passes through untouched. This is the single function
 *  every container boot/restart for the two-axis model computes its final
 *  server.properties/env from, so a type switch can never silently lose
